# The Gobbiebag Part VIII (jeuno 94): reqsMet's operands one at a time, in both checks. Parts I-VII completed (the
# chain's earlier parts, by a GM), Jeuno fame level 4. The inventory at 30 (a fresh char): no section (43 (81)); at 65
# (storage, a GM's player:changeContainerSize): fame level 3 (449 / 2 = 224): no section; Part VII set accepted (a GM):
# no section; all met: 43 (66, 0, 1), begun. Accepted: fame level 3: no section; Part VII accepted: no section (Part VII
# itself: its size 60 unmet); all met: 43 (66, 1, 1). A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over
# completed keeps it completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 450
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # the inventory 30, not 65: no section; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 65                    # a GM's player:changeContainerSize to the part's start size
fame Sandoria 449                       # a GM: fame level 3
trigger Bluffnix                        # below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 450                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii accepted # a GM: Part VII not completed
trigger Bluffnix                        # no section (Part VII: inventory 65 is not its 60); 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (66, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
fame Sandoria 449                       # a GM: fame level 3
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, below the fame level: no section; 43 (81)
finish
fame Sandoria 450                       # a GM
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVii completed # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # all met: 43 (66, 1, 1)
finish
